      │  ← Under D=0, I·E=δ, ρ=0: B(t) = B₀·e^{−γδt} → 0
      │
      │  ← Under D=0, I·E=δ, ρ>0: B(t) → ρ/(γδ) (new equilibrium)
      │
      └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────▶ t
      t=0                          t=T                                      t→∞

      LEGEND:
      ─────  Trajectory under sustained intervention (D = 0, ρ = 0)
      ·····  Trajectory under sustained divergence (D = D_max, ρ = ρ_max)
      ·-·-·  Upper bound (D_max + ρ_max)/(γδ)
      ═════  Equilibrium under restructuring (ρ > 0, D = 0)

