    │                                                                                              │
    │     Propagate through h:    Z_i = h(X_i(t|t−1))                                             │
    │     Predicted observation:  ẑ(t|t−1) = Σ W_i^(m) Z_i                                        │
    │     Innovation covariance:  S(t) = Σ W_i^(c) (Z_i − ẑ)(Z_i − ẑ)ᵀ + R                        │
    │     Cross-covariance:       P_xz(t) = Σ W_i^(c) (X_i − x̂)(Z_i − ẑ)ᵀ                         │
    │     Kalman gain:            K(t) = P_xz(t) S(t)⁻¹                                            │
    │     Updated mean:           x̂(t|t) = x̂(t|t−1) + K(t)[z(t) − ẑ(t|t−1)]                     │
    │     Updated covariance:     P(t|t) = P(t|t−1) − K(t) S(t) K(t)ᵀ                              │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                              │
                                              ▼
    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
